        "reviewed_claims": [
          "The Ashenvale quests article is marked as shared Classic/Forever content; its indexed revision is 6550117.",
          "Orendil Broadleaf offers Bathran's Hair and Orendil's Cure at Maestra's Post. Pelturas Whitemoon offers Elune's Tear, The Ruins of Stardust and Fallen Sky Lake at Astranaar. Shindrell Swiftfire offers Pridewings of Stonetalon at Astranaar.",
          "The listed chain order is Bathran's Hair, Orendil's Cure, Elune's Tear, The Ruins of Stardust, Fallen Sky Lake. This is a recorded order, not a complete eligibility solver."
        ],
        "redistribution": "Selected factual adaptation under CC-BY-SA-4.0; underlying Blizzard rights remain separate."
      }
